        "approx": "before the summer"
      },
      "kind": "state-change",
      "place": null,
      "text": "John and her brother, both physicians of high standing, told friends and relatives she has only temporary nervous depression; she takes tonics and journeys, has a prescribed schedule for each hour, and is absolutely forbidden to work.",
