        "P27",
        "P28",
        "P29",
        "P30",
        "P31",
        "P32",
        "P33"
      ],
      "says": "Your exercise depends on your strength, my dear, and your food somewhat on your appetite; but air you can absorb all the time."
    },
    {
      "id": "e02",
      "when": {
        "seq": 2
      },
      "kind": "perceive",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "The narrator found the wallpaper hateful, a sprawling yellow pattern whose curves commit suicide, and began her diary, putting it away when John came, since he hates to have her write.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "narrator",
          "role": "experiencer"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
