      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "The narrator asked John to let her visit Cousin Henry and Julia; he said she was not able, she cried before she finished, and he carried her upstairs and read to her; he said she must use her will and self-control.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "narrator",
