        "seq": 11
      },
      "kind": "perceive",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "She told herself it was lucky she and not the baby had the nursery; she stopped mentioning the paper to the others and watched it, and saw behind the pattern the shape of a woman stooping and creeping, clearer every day.",
