      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "By moonlight the figure seemed to shake the pattern as if to get out; the narrator rose to feel the paper and found John awake; she said she was not gaining and wished to go; he said the lease had three weeks to run, that she was gaining flesh and colour, and, when she began 'Better in body, perhaps', gave her a stern reproachful look and begged her never to let that idea enter her mind.",
      "who": [
