      "when": {
        "seq": 20,
        "approx": "two days before the lease ends"
      },
      "kind": "state",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "With two days to go she planned to get the top pattern off the under one, kept a second discovery to herself, thought John was beginning to notice and heard him question Jennie, and decided that John and Jennie were affected by sleeping under the paper.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "narrator",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "john",
          "role": "agent"
        },
