    {
      "id": "e22",
      "when": {
        "seq": 22
      },
      "kind": "act",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "In the morning she declared she would finish it, told Jennie she was tearing it out of spite, sent Jennie and everyone away, and the furniture was taken downstairs; she locked the door and threw the key into the front path.",
