        "approx": "that evening",
        "after": [
          "e23"
        ]
      },
      "kind": "speech",
      "place": "nursery",
      "text": "John came to the door and pounded, asked for an axe; she told him gently, again and again, that the key was by the front steps under a plantain leaf, until he fetched it and came in.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "john",
